    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Meta</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Microsoft</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Google</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n          <span class=\"chip k8s\">Kubernetes</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>File Sync (Dropbox / OneDrive)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Keep the same folder identical on your laptop, phone and office PC: upload only the pieces that changed, tell other devices within seconds, survive flaky Wi-Fi and 50 GB files, and never silently lose a version when two devices edit at once.</p>\n      "
